@HappyHoliday_HostAddress = http://localhost:5294
@clientToken = paste-client-access-token-here
@managerToken = paste-manager-access-token-here

### Register a client
POST {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Holiday Client",
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "password": "Client123!"
}

### Login (development manager: manager@happyholiday.local / Manager123!)
POST {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@happyholiday.local",
  "password": "Manager123!"
}

### View the authenticated profile
GET {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Manager-only endpoint
GET {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/users/manager-area
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Managers can create another manager
POST {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/auth/managers
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Another Manager",
  "email": "manager2@example.com",
  "password": "Manager456!"
}

###
